								39 00 00 0D B8 55 55 55 55 55 55 55 55 55 55 55 55
								39 00 00 21 B9 01 15 55 55 55 00 00 15 55 55 55 00 00 AA AA AA AA AA A0 AA AA AA AA AA A0 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
								39 00 00 09 BB 01 02 03 0A 04 13 14 00
								39 00 00 21 BC 00 00 00 00 04 00 FF F0 0B 33 50 49 33 33 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
								39 00 00 07 BD A1 A2 52 2E 00 8F
